OL,3,AWhy Northern Ireland was the 'perfect
OL,4,Aplace' for Robin Hood's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a centuries old legend of
OL,7,Fstealing from the rich to give to the
OL,8,Fpoor, freshly adapted for the big
OL,9,Fscreen, filmed entirely in Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FThe Death of Robin Hood is based on a
OL,13,F17th Century ballad of the outlaw,
OL,14,Fstarring Hugh Jackman as the
OL,15,Freflective, battle-weary titular
OL,16,Fcharacter at the end of his life. It
OL,17,Fpresents a darker, less family-friendly
OL,18,Fversion of the medieval hero.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
